  papers\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: Off
 icial 2027 CFP confirms Krakow\, Jul 12-16\, in person only\, with a mand
 atory full-paper abstract by Jan 18 and non-extensible Jan 25 full and po
 ster-only deadlines (poster-only needs no abstract). Paper cutoff hours a
 nd zone are unstated\, so AoE end-of-day is provisional\; tutorial propos
 als are stated AoE. Size L is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Genetic and 
 evolutionary computation\, including genetic algorithms\, genetic program
 ming\, swarm intelligence\, evolutionary multiobjective and combinatorial
